Sequence 3 origin GET-verified 2026-08-14T13:39:27Z (`delegated-ipfs.dev`, `cf-cache-status: MISS`) value `/ipfs/bafkreiesyfwcohnsr47o2eapym5ahwxzghpxpej253k6d4wygj4hrfnhp4`。Default URL without a cache-bust query may still serve sequence 1 until ~13:47Z (`Cache-Control: max-age=3600` from 12:47Z)。Later records from this publisher use a 5-minute TTL.

